#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:37
msgid "Experience the Beauty & Luxury of South Africa"
msgstr "Pata Urembo na Anasa ya Afrika Kusini"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:38
msgid "Discover breathtaking landscapes, vibrant cities, and unforgettable wildlife adventures across South Africa. From the stunning coastlines of Cape Town to thrilling safaris in Kruger National Park, every journey is designed to create lasting memories."
msgstr "Gundua mandhari ya kuvutia, miji hai, na matukio ya kusisimua ya wanyamapori kote Afrika Kusini. Kutoka ukanda wa pwani wa Cape Town hadi safari za kusisimua katika Hifadhi ya Taifa ya Kruger, kila safari imeundwa kuleta kumbukumbu za kudumu."

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:39
msgid "Enjoy luxury accommodations, guided wildlife tours, cultural experiences, wine tasting adventures, and scenic road trips with professionally curated travel packages tailored for every explorer."
msgstr "Furahia malazi ya kifahari, safari za wanyamapori zilizoongozwa, uzoefu wa kitamaduni, matukio ya kuonja divai, na safari za barabara za kupendeza na vifurushi vya usafiri vilivyotengenezwa kitaalamu kwa kila mgunduzi."

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:43
msgid "Luxury Safari Experiences"
msgstr "Uzoefu wa Safari za Kifahari"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:45
msgid "Cape Town City Tours"
msgstr "Safari za Jiji la Cape Town"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:47
msgid "Beach & Coastal Escapes"
msgstr "Mapumziko ya Pwani na Ukanda"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:49
msgid "Adventure Activities"
msgstr "Shughuli za Matukio"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:51
msgid "Wine & Cultural Tours"
msgstr "Safari za Divai na Utamaduni"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:53
msgid "24/7 Travel Assistance"
