#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:56
msgid "Explore South Africa Tours"
msgstr "Gundua Safari za Afrika Kusini"


#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:75
msgid "Explore West Africa"
msgstr "Gundua Afrika Magharibi"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:76
msgid "Discover Culture, History & Adventure"
msgstr "Gundua Utamaduni, Historia na Matukio"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:77
msgid "Experience the rich traditions, colorful cultures, and vibrant destinations of West Africa. From historical landmarks and bustling cities to tropical beaches and wildlife reserves, every destination offers something unique."
msgstr "Pata tajriba ya mila tajiri, tamaduni za rangi, na maeneo hai ya Afrika Magharibi. Kutoka alama za kihistoria na miji yenye shughuli nyingi hadi fukwe za kitropiki na hifadhi za wanyamapori, kila eneo linatoa kitu cha kipekee."

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:78
msgid "Our West Africa tours combine authentic cultural encounters, comfortable travel experiences, local cuisine adventures, and guided excursions across some of Africa's most exciting destinations."
msgstr "Safari zetu za Afrika Magharibu zinachanganya mikutano ya kitamaduni halisi, uzoefu wa kusafiri kwa starehe, matukio ya vyakula vya kienyeji, na matembezi yaliyoongozwa katika baadhi ya maeneo ya kusisimua zaidi barani Afrika."

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:82
msgid "Cultural Heritage Tours"
msgstr "Safari za Urithi wa Utamaduni"

#: Home/templates/Home/about.html:84
