# ==================== TRAVEL PARTNERSHIPS.HTML TRANSLATIONS ====================

#: Home/templates/Home/travel_partnerships.html:4
msgid "Travel Partnerships - Days Safaris Adventures"
msgstr "Ushirikiano wa Kusafiri - Days Safaris Adventures"

#: Home/templates/Home/travel_partnerships.html:31
msgid "Explore Our Travel Partnerships"
msgstr "Gundua Ushirikiano Wetu wa Kusafiri"

#: Home/templates/Home/travel_partnerships.html:32
msgid "Day Safaris Adventures has partnered with award-winning tour operators to bring you the best Travel Tours and flight plans across the globe. Whether you are looking to explore Africa, Asia or the United States, temples, embark on an off-the-beaten-track adventure or discover the wonders of the world, we can help you plan your perfect trip."
msgstr "Day Safaris Adventures imeshirikiana na waendeshaji watalii walioshinda tuzo kukuletea Safari bora za Kusafiri na mipango ya ndege kote ulimwenguni. Iwe unatafuta kuchunguza Afrika, Asia au Marekani, mahekalu, kuanza safari isiyo ya kawaida au kugundua maajabu ya ulimwengu, tunaweza kukusaidia kupanga safari yako bora."

#: Home/templates/Home/travel_partnerships.html:33
msgid "Enjoy the benefits of an African tour to West Africa, South Africa or Egypt among other countries and explore multiple fascinating cultures and countries in one go, whether you are looking to sight see in historic cities, and enjoy various cuisines and dine on the finest food in the world. Admire wildlife on African safari with our Africa tours, or take a trip to the United Arab Emirates and marvel at the modern architectural wonders of cities like Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, or the amazing sites like the Palm Islands, Burj Khalifa and Sheikh Zayed."
msgstr "Furahia manufaa ya safari ya Kiafrika hadi Afrika Magharibi, Afrika Kusini au Misri miongoni mwa nchi nyingine na uchunguze tamaduni na nchi nyingi za kuvutia kwa mkupuo mmoja, iwe unatafuta kutalii katika miji ya kihistoria, na kufurahia vyakula mbalimbali na kula chakula bora zaidi duniani. Pendeza wanyamapori kwenye safari za Kiafrika na safari zetu za Afrika, au fanya safari ya Falme za Kiarabu na ustaajabu maajabu ya kisasa ya usanifu wa miji kama Dubai, Abu Dhabi na Sharjah, au maeneo ya kustaajabisha kama Palm Islands, Burj Khalifa na Sheikh Zayed."

